#: ../../troubleshooting/pdf_troubleshooting.rst:4
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../troubleshooting/pdf_troubleshooting.rst:8
msgid "Sometimes things don't go as planned, and you need to find out what has gone wrong in order to correct the problem. This section provides information on how to get started troubleshooting problems encountered while using MusicBrainz Picard."
msgstr ""
"有时事情不会按计划进行，你需要找出出了什么问题才能纠正它。本节提供了有关如何"
"在使用 MusicBrainz Picard 时遇到问题时如何开始进行故障排除的信息。"
